<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>美国保障房抽签HOT</title><link>https://us-housing-lottery-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>收纽约 Housing Connect、旧金山 DAHLIA、洛杉矶 Access Housing LA、圣何塞 Housing Portal、波士顿 Metrolist 的公开抽签：按截止日排序，只显示自己改写的标题与一句话简介、城市、套数、截止日与官方申请链接，不转载原文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:17:50 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>布鲁克林抽签11月20日截止：只有3套可负担出租房</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7710</link><description>11月20日截止，但布鲁克林这处只有 3 套，中签面很窄，我的建议是顺手报一个，主力还是放在同周截止的大盘上。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7ab21176aecd853a97e3067154ed96f121f632</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7710">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>纽约抽签11月20日截止：18套可负担出租房，全是低收入档</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7630</link><description>11月20日截止：纽约市这处 18 套房全是低收入档，从开间到两居都有，单身和小家庭都能找到合适的户型，搭配算均衡。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cf89c19c5ad1a34a2ba68a842128ee5797e5a783</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7630">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>皇后区抽签11月20日截止：4套两居可负担出租房</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7665</link><description>皇后区11月20日截止：只有 4 套两居，全是低收入档，盘子很小，符合条件就报一个，但别只押这一处。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">065ec8ec94d8f858ba0728aa2e5a59a2c87883b4</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7665">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>曼哈顿抽签11月20日截止：20套可负担出租房，面向中等收入</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7338</link><description>曼哈顿11月20日截止：20 套房面向中等收入，一居到三居都有，曼哈顿的盘本来就少，收入档对得上的家庭别放过这处。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">23381dd52d2d07572829099113a8318b84caf587</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7338">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>布朗克斯抽签11月20日截止：只有3套两居可负担出租房</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7729</link><description>布朗克斯11月20日截止：只有 3 套两居，全是低收入档，盘子太小，我的看法是当作顺手多报的一处，别当主力。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4c92fcb14e8ea35c58c03b3b8ef9ead8f41b5c84</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7729">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>布朗克斯抽签11月23日截止：6套可负担出租房</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7728</link><description>布朗克斯11月23日截止：6 套低收入房，开间、一居、两居都有，今天不用抢，但最好定个提醒，日子过得很快。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0caec92f40b839576bcc547fbdcfea69d37cec35</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7728">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>布鲁克林大盘抽签：217套可负担出租房，11月25日截止</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7718</link><description>本周最大的盘：布鲁克林 217 套房，11月25日截止，极低、很低、低收入档都有，开间到三居齐全，如果这周只能报一个抽签，我的建议就是报它。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5356991e24d526fea33c80d3442f82b17b2d5839</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7718">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>布朗克斯抽签开到12月18日：6套可负担出租房</title><link>https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7663</link><description>全站窗口最长的一处：布朗克斯这处抽签开到 12 月 18 日，6 套低收入一居和两居，这周不用赶，慢慢对好收入档再提交。</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Dec 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ce9e75020c95cd15794d8078fb7cade13bf412e1</guid><source url="https://housingconnect.nyc.gov/PublicWeb/details/7663">NYC Open Data: Housing Connect Lotteries</source></item><item><title>旧金山抽签11月20日截止：62套全新可负担出租房</title><link>https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000L0PAPEA3</link><description>11月20日截止：旧金山这处62套全新出租房是今天在开的盘里最大的一处，抽签制，先对一下收入档再提交，别拖到截止当晚。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">74242c1b9dca3f8c7c9f08d12129a69c36fb9e4c</guid><source url="https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000L0PAPEA3">San Francisco DAHLIA Listings</source></item><item><title>旧金山等候名单12月2日截止：仅2套可负担出租房</title><link>https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000IbxrZEAR</link><description>这处只有2套房，报的是等候名单不是抽签，名额极少，收入档合适再排队，别抱太高期望。</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Dec 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">de16574e3cdaeb698bd5f25bc959482d3c6c643c</guid><source url="https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000IbxrZEAR">San Francisco DAHLIA Listings</source></item><item><title>旧金山等候名单12月4日截止：37套可负担出租房</title><link>https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000JaZE1EAN</link><description>37套房走等候名单，12月4日截止登记，盘不算小，但等候名单拼的是排位不是运气，收入档对得上就早点登记。</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Dec 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">aecacf9300ce82e7d03ddc71a3d695ef6082bc77</guid><source url="https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000JaZE1EAN">San Francisco DAHLIA Listings</source></item><item><title>旧金山抽签12月9日截止：21套全新可负担出租房</title><link>https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000L5DdFEAV</link><description>21套全新出租房，抽签制，12月9日截止，适合想住新盘的家庭，先确认收入档再提交。</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Dec 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a1a5a7eb4db5105f73405ee596b34f30a431743b</guid><source url="https://housing.sfgov.org/listings/a0W7y00000L5DdFEAV">San Francisco DAHLIA Listings</source></item><item><title>圣何塞先到先得12月1日截止：仅剩1套长者可负担房</title><link>https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/f3c39f79-3c9e-422c-b2e8-a2b4e9c66651/quail_hills_senior_apartments_1260_piedmont_road_san_jose_ca</link><description>只剩1套长者房源，先到先得不抽签，12月1日就截止，名额只有一个，符合条件的长者家庭别拖到最后一刻。</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Dec 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">eb553d384608a625e99d768806da2f05a0b7c045</guid><source url="https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/f3c39f79-3c9e-422c-b2e8-a2b4e9c66651/quail_hills_senior_apartments_1260_piedmont_road_san_jose_ca">San Jose Housing Portal</source></item><item><title>圣何塞先到先得12月13日截止：6套长者可负担房</title><link>https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/6cd66480-5ae7-47fd-8000-f4a09fcb1171/palm_court_senior_apartments_1200_lick_ave_san_jose_ca</link><description>6套长者房源一次放出，先到先得，12月13日截止，窗口在长者项目里算宽裕，适合想换到市中心附近的长者家庭。</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2026 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e428543be19a7e0ccc1b3ea14dfe0a5a57af1768</guid><source url="https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/6cd66480-5ae7-47fd-8000-f4a09fcb1171/palm_court_senior_apartments_1200_lick_ave_san_jose_ca">San Jose Housing Portal</source></item><item><title>圣何塞先到先得明年1月2日截止：2套可负担出租房</title><link>https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/f11b8dea-a509-4f66-bb6d-3ad47a99bc68/quetzal_gardens_7_n_king_rd_san_jos_ca</link><description>2套房先到先得，截止日跨到明年1月2日，时间充裕但只有2套，想申请的家庭可以先备好材料再递交。</description><pubDate>Sat, 02 Jan 2027 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">061c15bffb6aeb7cce491def6b3375dbe548278b</guid><source url="https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/f11b8dea-a509-4f66-bb6d-3ad47a99bc68/quetzal_gardens_7_n_king_rd_san_jos_ca">San Jose Housing Portal</source></item><item><title>圣何塞先到先得明年2月1日截止：6套家庭可负担房</title><link>https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/0a4d4495-8659-4b72-a3c8-363eb8577bdf/meridian_family_apartments_969_meridian_ave_san_jose_ca</link><description>6套家庭房源先到先得，截止日到明年2月1日，是本轮窗口最长的一处，适合需要时间准备收入证明的家庭。</description><pubDate>Mon, 01 Feb 2027 15:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0d3d09ebfba7e47eaabb036f123f361e5c328014</guid><source url="https://housing.sanjoseca.gov/listing/0a4d4495-8659-4b72-a3c8-363eb8577bdf/meridian_family_apartments_969_meridian_ave_san_jose_ca">San Jose Housing Portal</source></item><item><title>洛杉矶先到先得12月1日截止：仅剩1套可负担出租房</title><link>https://access.housing.lacity.gov/listing/6268f6d0-768b-4e53-a665-1006abfbf6d4/hermoyne_apartments_569_n_rossmore_a